think Standfast first: the ledger stands where two prior laps left it, every living row closed, so the line was clear.
think Council rota row 1, Saturn and air -- law and boundary. TAME core, single-stranded, Conway's law. The single-stranded reading named this lap exactly: one fact, one place. A rule written in twenty files is twenty facts that must agree, which is the definition of many-stranded.
think Measured before touching. Twenty rungs hold read_the_finding byte for byte at fifty-five lines; one rung, deem, holds a genuinely different body at the same length. So the fold is exactly twenty, and deem stays.
think Checked the contract: twenty-three symbols, every one already public in all twenty rungs. This fold widened nothing, the second in a row to need no declaration changed anywhere on the ladder.
obs The body is a boundary through and through, which is why the air row fit it. The wire before the memory: the forum comes off the wire rather than out of anything a run remembered, the case is rebuilt from the same three facts the referring copied, and the note an operator opens is read back before the report believes the finding arrived. Twenty copies of a boundary are twenty places it may quietly drift; one copy holds for every rung that calls it.
obs Three folds now share one arithmetic. Carry 86,774 to 83,710 across the three, a fall of 3,064, while delegates rise 2,444 to 2,518, exactly the seventy-four stubs that replaced the bodies. The two readings move apart by better than forty to one each time, which is what tells a fold from a cost moved somewhere cheaper to count.
obs The harness pattern is proven at four widths now -- seventeen, twenty, thirty-seven, and seventy-nine rungs -- and at four depths, from seventeen lines to a hundred and thirty-seven. Neither width nor depth has yet asked anything new of the shape, which is the argument for taking the queue in order rather than by intuition.
obs No cairn is owed. A lift is the shallowest of the three depths of removal, and nothing left the tree that was not byte-identical to something that stayed.
