recommend keep-going the queue's head is may_pass at 51 rungs by 19 lines, then choose_pass at 43 by 22, then book_the_debt at 18 by 54. may_pass is the crux by width -- fifty-one rungs, the widest family left -- and book_the_debt is the crux by depth. Beside them the machine half of the address space stays owed and named: page-table entry bytes, an ASID from seL4_ASIDPoolBits, the retype itself. The libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word, still blocking rungs 3 and 4 of the Microkernel Target arc.
